tps://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-01-28T15:18:14Z","updated_at":"2026-05-23T00:26:59Z","closed_at":"2026-05-23T00:26:59Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nObserved in Godot 4.6-stable: Linux Mint 22.0 (official and self-compiled) and Android (from Google Play).\nNot reproduced in Godot 4.5.1-stable or Godot 4.5.2-rc1.\n\n### System information\n\nLinux Mint 22.0 or Android - Godot 4.6-stable - Any renderer\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn editor, with a MultiplayerSynchronizer node selected, switching scenes causes the following error to print multiple times:\nERROR: scene/main/node.cpp:2354 - Parameter \"common_parent\" is null.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nIn editor:\n- Open scene and select a MultiplayerSynchronizer\n- Switch to another scene (which has at least one node)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nMRP added, includes main.tscn (with the syncer) and other.tscn (with just a node)\nAlternatively just create a quick project:\n- Add some node, add a MultiplayerSynchronizer\n- Create a new scene, add a node\n- Observe the described effects\n(The scenes don't need to be saved, but they do need a node)\n\n[bug-mpsync-tab-change.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24914016/bug-mpsync-tab-change.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users